0..69 Comment "// A site offering a store of strings, the `Store` its role requires."
70..72 Comment "//"
73..150 Comment "// A site\'s offer lives in its own file, so the program never names the place"
151..169 Comment "// that serves it."
170..172 Comment "//"
173..249 Comment "// The offer is `Offers`, a model of the site\'s own theory `Hosted`. It need"
250..325 Comment "// not be the program\'s `Store`. It must hold each member of `Store` at its"
326..364 Comment "// type. This one also offers a clock."
365..367 Comment "//"
